%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor Seller as Vendedor
    actor Buyer as Comprador
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BFF as BFF Gateway
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant QW as Queue Worker
    participant OC as Offchain Consumer
    participant BC as Blockchain (Besu)
    participant EL as Event Listener

    Buyer->>FE: Seleciona propriedade para comprar
    FE->>BFF: POST /api/transfers/request<br/>{matriculaId, buyerCpf}
    BFF->>Orch: POST /transfers/request + JWT

    Orch->>Orch: Validar propriedade (status OK)
    Orch->>DB: Verificar transferência ativa
    DB-->>Orch: Nenhuma transferência ativa

    Orch->>DB: Buscar buyer por CPF
    DB-->>Orch: Buyer data {id, walletAddress}

    Orch->>DB: INSERT transfer<br/>status = PENDENTE
    DB-->>Orch: Transfer ID created

    Orch->>MQ: Publish CONFIGURE_TRANSFER job<br/>{transferId, seller, buyer, matricula, approvers[]}
    Orch->>DB: UPDATE status = CONFIGURANDO
    Orch-->>BFF: 201 Created {transferId}
    BFF-->>FE: Transfer initiated
    FE-->>Buyer: Transferência iniciada

    MQ-->>QW: Consume CONFIGURE_TRANSFER job
    QW->>OC: POST /api/transfers/request<br/>{from, to, matricula}

    OC->>OC: Build transaction
    OC->>BC: requestPropertyTransfer(from, to, matricula)
    BC-->>OC: TX Hash: 0xdef...

    BC->>BC: Mine transaction
    BC->>BC: Create pending transfer struct<br/>Calculate requestHash
    BC->>BC: Emit TransferRequested<br/>{requestHash, matricula, from, to, requester}

    BC-->>EL: Event detected
    EL->>EL: Extract event.args[0] = requestHash<br/>Extract event.transactionHash
    EL->>Orch: POST /webhooks/.../transfer-requested<br/>{transferHash, matriculaId, from, to, txHash}
    Orch->>DB: UPDATE transfer<br/>request_hash, blockchain_tx_hash<br/>status = AGUARDANDO_APROVACOES
    Orch-->>EL: 200 OK

    Note over Seller,BC: === Fase de Aprovações (3 instituições) ===

    Seller->>FE: Instituição Financeira aprova
    FE->>BFF: POST /api/transfers/{id}/approve
    BFF->>Orch: POST /transfers/{id}/approve<br/>{approverId}
    Orch->>MQ: Publish APPROVE_TRANSFER job<br/>{transferId, approver: FINANCIAL}
    MQ-->>QW: Consume job
    QW->>OC: POST /api/transfers/approve<br/>{requestHash, institution: FINANCIAL}
    OC->>BC: approveTransferAsFinancial(requestHash)
    BC->>BC: pendingTransfers[requestHash]<br/>.financialApproved = true
    BC->>BC: Emit TransferApproved<br/>{requestHash, "FINANCIAL", approverAddress}
    BC-->>EL: Event detected
    EL->>Orch: POST /webhooks/.../transfer-approved<br/>{requestHash, institution, approver}
    Orch->>DB: Record approval 1/3
    Orch-->>EL: 200 OK

    Note over BC: Cartório aprova (2/3)

    Seller->>FE: Cartório aprova
    FE->>BFF: POST /api/transfers/{id}/approve
    BFF->>Orch: POST /transfers/{id}/approve
    Orch->>MQ: Publish APPROVE_TRANSFER job
    MQ-->>QW: Consume
    QW->>OC: POST /api/transfers/approve<br/>{requestHash, institution: REGISTRY_OFFICE}
    OC->>BC: approveTransferAsRegistryOffice(requestHash)
    BC->>BC: pendingTransfers[requestHash]<br/>.registryOfficeApproved = true
    BC->>BC: Emit TransferApproved
    BC-->>EL: Event detected
    EL->>Orch: POST /webhooks/.../transfer-approved
    Orch->>DB: Record approval 2/3

    Note over BC: Prefeitura aprova (3/3)

    Seller->>FE: Prefeitura aprova
    FE->>BFF: POST /api/transfers/{id}/approve
    BFF->>Orch: POST /transfers/{id}/approve
    Orch->>MQ: Publish APPROVE_TRANSFER job
    MQ-->>QW: Consume
    QW->>OC: POST /api/transfers/approve<br/>{requestHash, institution: MUNICIPALITY}
    OC->>BC: approveTransferAsMunicipality(requestHash)
    BC->>BC: pendingTransfers[requestHash]<br/>.municipalityApproved = true
    BC->>BC: Emit TransferApproved
    BC-->>EL: Event detected
    EL->>Orch: POST /webhooks/.../transfer-approved
    Orch->>DB: Record approval 3/3

    Note over Buyer,BC: === Aceitação do Comprador ===

    Buyer->>FE: Aceita a transferência
    FE->>BFF: POST /api/transfers/{id}/accept
    BFF->>Orch: POST /transfers/{id}/accept<br/>{buyerId}
    Orch->>Orch: Validar buyer é o correto
    Orch->>MQ: Publish ACCEPT_TRANSFER job
    MQ-->>QW: Consume
    QW->>OC: POST /api/transfers/accept<br/>{requestHash, buyerAddress}
    OC->>BC: buyerAcceptsTransfer(requestHash)

    BC->>BC: Check: all 3 approvals + buyer acceptance?
    BC->>BC: Auto-execute transfer!<br/>Transfer tokens: seller → buyer<br/>Update propertyOwner[matricula]
    BC->>BC: pendingTransfers[requestHash].executed = true
    BC->>BC: Emit TransferExecuted<br/>{requestHash, matricula, from, to}

    BC-->>EL: Event detected
    EL->>Orch: POST /webhooks/.../transfer-executed<br/>{requestHash, matriculaId, from, to, txHash}
    Orch->>DB: UPDATE property<br/>proprietario = buyer.id<br/>status = OK
    Orch->>DB: UPDATE transfer<br/>status = CONCLUIDA
    Orch-->>EL: 200 OK

    Note over FE: Frontend polling ou WebSocket
    FE->>BFF: GET /api/transfers/{id}
    BFF->>Orch: GET /transfers/{id}
    Orch->>DB: SELECT transfer
    DB-->>Orch: {status: CONCLUIDA, ...}
    Orch-->>BFF: Transfer completed
    BFF-->>FE: Transfer data
    FE-->>Buyer: Transferência concluída! ✅
    FE-->>Seller: Propriedade transferida
